			description: [
				"The &ePhytogenic Insolator&r grows crops with power instead of time - drop in a seed and some water and it returns a full harvest plus extra seeds."
				""
				"It stacks neatly with the &eMystical Agriculture&r essence farm you already run and with &eBotany Pots&r: pots for hands-off passive growth, the Insolator for when you want a specific crop &oright now&r and have power to spend."
