		{
			dependencies: ["7E2000000000000D"]
			description: [
				"&eConveyor Belts&r are IE's item transport, and they are deliberately not pipes - items ride on top where you can watch them, get picked up by hoppers, or be dropped into a furnace at the end of the line."
				""
				"They are slower than every other option in this pack and that is fine. Use them where the base is meant to look like a factory rather than a wall of hidden cables."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:conveyor_basic"
