			description: [
				"The &eInduction Smelter&r combines two inputs - the alloying machine, and Thermal's route to richer ore processing."
				""
				"&e&lWith Rich Slag or Cinnabar it produces extra output&r, taking Thermal's ore chain past simple doubling."
				""
				"&7It makes every Thermal alloy: Electrum, Invar, Constantan, Signalum, Lumium, Enderium. Those alloys are what the higher machines and augments are built from.&r"
