		{
			dependencies: ["9200000000000004"]
			description: [
				"The &eCentrifugal Separator&r splits materials into components; the &eMagma Crucible&r melts solids into fluids; the &eBlast Chiller&r freezes fluids into solids."
				""
				"&e&lThe Crucible is the useful one here&r - it turns cobblestone into lava directly, which feeds Magmatic Dynamos and your obsidian line without a Cyclic Melter."
				""
				"&7The Centrifuge processes mob drops, ores and sludge into usable components. It is the tidiest way to deal with Industrial Foregoing's by-products.&r"
